                "fontFamily": "Inter",
                "text": "Device, status line, and the mapping list. Sweeps and switches, global to the rig. \u201cSimulate input\u201d feeds a synthetic event in wherever a real one would land \u2014 a listening learn capture first, else the open row, else it is dimmed. The event enters through the controller seam itself, the same shape a real CC delivers, so nothing downstream can tell the difference and nothing grows a test-only branch."
              }
